BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:njit-externalorgtablingnjitis-cba8aec0da@nascentmaterials.com
DTSTAMP:20260814T171701Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260902
SUMMARY:[minor] NJIT - External org tabling: NJIT is Category 4\, lowest pr
 iority
LOCATION:Strategic Events and Conference Services
DESCRIPTION:SCALE: minor\n\nUnder the Facilities Use Policy (eff. 2024-10-1
 1) an outside company is Category 4 'Non-University Affiliated/External'\,
  last in a 7-tier priority order. Requires an executed Facilities Use Lice
 nse Agreement plus a COI approved BEFORE confirmation: CGL $1M/$2M includi
 ng sexual molestation and abuse coverage\, Workers' Comp statutory + $1M E
 L\, $1M auto\, $2M umbrella. Rate categories exist but dollar amounts are 
 unpublished. Checked specifically: there is no blanket ban on commercial s
 olicitation - outside companies are simply deprioritized\, charged rent an
 d gated on insurance.\n\nOUTREACH NOTE: CHEAPER ROUTE: partner with a reco
 gnized student org. Category 2 events pay no space fee but need OSIL staff
  pre-approval. Note campuscenter.njit.edu now redirects to strategicevents
 .njit.edu.\n\nSOURCE: https://www.njit.edu/policies/facilities-use-policy-
 events-and-conferences\n\n(Compiled 2026-08-10. Verify before acting.)
CATEGORIES:NJIT\,minor
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
